---
---
<div class="bento-container">
  <a href="https://github.com/shyam-s00/gopher-glide" class="bento-card bento-large">
    <div class="bento-content">
      <div class="bento-icon">⭐</div>
      <h3>Open Source & Free</h3>
      <p>Gopher-Glide is built for the community. Drop us a star on GitHub to support the project!</p>
      <span class="bento-link">View Repository &rarr;</span>
    </div>
  </a>
  <div class="bento-column">
    <div class="bento-card bento-small">
      <div class="bento-content">
        <div class="bento-icon">🐹</div>
        <h3>Built in pure Go</h3>
        <p>No heavy JVMs or Node.js runtimes. Just a blazing fast binary.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a href="/getting-started" class="bento-card bento-small bento-accent">
      <div class="bento-content">
        <div class="bento-icon">📚</div>
        <h3>Read the Docs</h3>
        <p>Zero to load testing in under 2 minutes.</p>
        <span class="bento-link">Get Started &rarr;</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .bento-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 1.5rem auto 3rem auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .bento-column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .bento-card {
    background: var(--gg-glass-bg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border: 1px solid var(--gg-glass-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--gg-glass-shadow);
  }
  .bento-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px var(--gg-glass-shadow-hover);
    border-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
  }
  .bento-large {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gg-glass-bg), var(--gg-glass-bg));
  }
  .bento-accent {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(198, 160, 246, 0.1), var(--gg-glass-bg));
    border-color: rgba(198, 160, 246, 0.3);
  }
  .bento-icon {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .bento-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-text);
  }
  .bento-small .bento-content h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .bento-content p {
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .bento-link {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: auto;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .bento-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
